   "date": "2013-12-02",
   "stage_hint": null,
   "brief": "The True-up Shortfall Levy (Excise) Carbon Tax Repeal) Bill 2013 was moved for a second reading. It imposes a levy to recover the value of over-allocated free carbon units under the Jobs and Competitiveness Program for 2013-14, applying only where it is not a duty of customs or excise."
